B.JT=new A.aB("Across the week, most stakeholders wrote in about device and login trouble after the term rollover, with a second cluster asking how to enrol a new student. Transport questions were routine \u2014 route times and stop locations \u2014 and two facility reports were escalated the same day.","Across the month, stakeholders most often asked about enrolment and registration for new students, bus service and schedules, and how to reach daily lunch menus online. Technology issues recur throughout \u2014 password resets, login access, printers and classroom boards \u2014 and are routed to the help desk. Several tickets raise safety concerns, with guidance to report through a trusted adult.","Across the quarter, stakeholders frequently seek information on enrolment and registration for new students, bus service and schedules, and access to daily lunch menus online. Dress code inquiries recur, as do questions about the first day of school, the academic calendar, and extracurricular programmes. Several tickets address safety concerns and bullying policy with guidance to report through a trusted adult. Technology issues (password resets, login access, printers, classroom boards) and support plan requests also appear, with direction to contact the service desk.")
